th a dagger, but the intruder turns in the black chamber, and the prince collapses dead; the revelers rush in only to find the mask empty, realizing the Red Death itself has infiltrated their sanctuary, and one by one, all die as the clock stops and darkness claims the abbey.</div>\n   794→                \n   795→                \n   796→                <div class=\"chapter-characters\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem;\">\n   797→                    <strong style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; color: var(--muted);\">Characters:</strong>\n   798→                    \n   799→                    <span class=\"tag\">Prince Prospero</span>\n   800→                    \n   801→                    <span class=\"tag\">The masked figure (Red Death)</span>\n   802→                    \n   803→                    \n   804→                </div>\n   805→                \n   806→            </div>\n   807→            \n   808→        </section>\n   809→        </div>\n   810→\n   811→        <div id=\"characters\" class=\"tab-content\">\n   812→        <section>\n   813→            <h2>👥 Character Guide</h2>\n   814→\n   815→            <!-- Confidence Filter -->\n   816→            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">\n   817→                <label style=\"color: var(--muted); margin-right: 0.5rem;\">\n   818→                    <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"show-low-confidence-only\" onchange=\"filterByConfidence(this.checked)\">\n   819→                    Show only low-confidence items\n   820→                </label>\n   821→            </div>\n   822→\n   823→            \n   824→\n   825→            \n   826→            <div class=\"character-group\">\n   827→                <h3>Supporting Characters <span class=\"count\">1</span></h3>\n   828→                <table>\n   829→                    <thead>\n   830→                        <tr>\n   831→                            <th>Name</th>\n   832→                            <th>Mentions</th>\n   833→                            <th